<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<!--
  <summary>
  The settings preview map (roadmap item 47, 05/11/2026): which Skin
  Settings rows have a preview under the help text, and for the live stage
  which region of Home each row changes. The sister of Includes_SettingsHelp
  and kept in step with it by tests/test_settings_preview.py.
  </summary>
  <remarks>
  settings_preview_shown lists the rows previewed on the live stage, each
  in exactly one stage_region_* expression; settings_preview_image lists
  the rows a picture pair shows instead, their pictures named by the
  SettingsPreviewPicture and SettingsPreviewPictureNow variables, which
  build_preview_art.py writes from its own table. The rows of later sub
  items join these lists as they are built, and settings_preview_none
  names the rows that have no preview on purpose.
  </remarks>
-->
