	<!-- Rows with no preview on purpose: the custom accent picker, the log
	     folder rows, debug logging, the backup rows, Reduce Motion (motion is
	     not a picture) and Preview Settings itself. -->
	<!-- Also no preview: the small grid column count (a count that reads from
	     its label), the four sort order rows (an order is not a picture) and
	     the four cache rows (numbers and an action), and the last played date,
	     which no picture run can show since nothing it sets up has been played,
	     and the title age on the info screens, which always draw the focused
	     film's own fanart behind the line, so no picture of it can be taken
	     that does not ship a slice of the user's library.
	     Sub item 5, the last three pages. Lists and Favourites: the porting
	     choice, export and import (actions), the default favourites filter (a
	     default, not a picture), and the two lists screen switches, whose
	     screen shows the user's own lists, so a picture would need a list
	     made up for the run and written into the user's lists.json. Add-ons:
	     the lists API switch (behaviour, no look), and the Engage list and
	     the three coming up rows, which change the coming up list drawn in
	     Home.xml outside the stage's includes from another add-on's live
	     data. Radarr: four form fields and two actions. -->
